---
// The "why you'd want these" section: a 2x2 grid of the four headline features, plus a full-width
// disclaimer card. This is where the scale + legend details live now (they used to be scattered in
// the footer / hero stats).
---

<section class="features" id="features">
  <div class="features-grid">
    <article class="feature panel">
      <span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path
            d="M12 2 21 7v10l-9 5-9-5V7l9-5Z M12 2v20 M3 7l9 5 9-5"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.6"
            stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
        </svg>
      </span>
      <h3>Top &amp; Side Views</h3>
      <p>
        Each building drawn from five orthographic angles &mdash; top, front, back, left, and right.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="feature panel">
      <span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <rect x="2" y="8" width="20" height="8" rx="1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.6"></rect>
          <path d="M6 8v3 M10 8v4 M14 8v3 M18 8v4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
        </svg>
      </span>
      <h3>Consistent Scale</h3>
      <p>
        Everything is drawn at <strong>1&thinsp;m = 20&thinsp;px</strong>, so buildings line up when
        you drop them side by side. One foundation = 8&thinsp;m &mdash; set an 8&thinsp;px grid in
        Excalidraw, or draw.io's default 10&thinsp;px lines up too.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="feature panel">
      <span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"
          ></circle>
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.5" fill="currentColor"></circle>
          <path d="M12 1v3 M12 20v3 M1 12h3 M20 12h3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
        </svg>
      </span>
      <h3>Annotations</h3>
      <p>
        Input and output ports plus collision-box corners are marked, so you can route belts and
        pipes and check spacing before laying a single foundation.
      </p>
      <ul class="legend">
        <li><span class="chip in"></span> Input port</li>
        <li><span class="chip out"></span> Output port</li>
        <li><span class="chip tick"></span> Collision corner</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="feature panel">
      <span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <rect x="3" y="3" width="8" height="8" rx="1.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.6"></rect>
          <rect x="13" y="3" width="8" height="8" rx="1.5" fill="currentColor"></rect>
          <rect x="3" y="13" width="8" height="8" rx="1.5" fill="currentColor"></rect>
          <rect x="13" y="13" width="8" height="8" rx="1.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.6"></rect>
        </svg>
      </span>
      <h3>Multiple Themes</h3>
      <p>
        Four ready-made looks: crisp <strong>Blue Schematic</strong> or
        hand-drawn <strong>Blue Excalidraw</strong>, each with a clean annotation-free variant.
        Browse available themes below.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="feature panel feature-wide">
      <span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path d="M12 3 22 20H2L12 3Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"
            stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
          <path d="M12 10v4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"
            stroke-linecap="round"></path>
          <circle cx="12" cy="17" r="1" fill="currentColor"></circle>
        </svg>
      </span>
      <h3>Disclaimer</h3>
      <p>
        This project is completely independent and is not endorsed by, sponsored by, or affiliated
        with the game <strong>Satisfactory</strong> or its
        developers, <strong>Coffee Stain Studios</strong>. All game titles, logos, and assets belong
        to their respective copyright and trademark owners.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .features {
    max-width: 72rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2rem) clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2.5rem) clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
  }
  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1.1rem;
  }
  .feature {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    align-content: flex-start;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 1.75rem);
  }
  .feature-wide {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }
  .feature-icon {
    display: inline-grid;
    place-items: center;
    flex: none;
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    color: var(--color-ficsit);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-ficsit) 14%, transparent);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-ficsit) 40%, var(--color-metal));
  }
  .feature-icon svg {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
  }
  .feature h3 {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }
  .feature-wide h3 {
    color: var(--color-ficsit);
  }
  .feature p {
    flex-basis: 100%;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-ink-dim);
  }
  .feature strong {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .legend {
    flex-basis: 100%;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem 1.1rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--color-ink-dim);
  }
  .legend li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .chip {
    width: 13px;
    height: 13px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    flex: none;
  }
  .chip.in {
    background: #c82828;
  }
  .chip.out {
    background: #28aa46;
  }
  .chip.tick {
    background: transparent;
    border: 2px solid var(--color-ficsit);
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .features-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
